# insecuretlsban

When reviewing code or CI for this project, apply insecuretlsban checks:

Flag insecure TLS (verify=False, NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0).

Report findings with file paths and concrete remediation. Do not invent findings.
